.TH WERKMEISTER-MACHINE-SETUP 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-machine\-setup \- Guided machine setup: walks through paths, ingress domains and the ~/.werkmeister service registry, then converges the plugins, the sandbox\-workspace checkout, the TLS certificate and the optional issue tracker, Telepresence and VS Code YAML\-schema prerequisites \" name-check: ignore
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister machine setup\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Report prerequisite state without prompting or running any install/update commands
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Non\-interactive: accept every default and skip optional installs
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The guided first run (and re\-run) of a werkmeister machine. It asks everything up front, then walks through each prerequisite that lives outside the checkout: paths, browser, ingress, the service registry, the issue tracker, and optional tools (telepresence, the superpowers plugin, editor settings). It writes the machine\-global config in \fB~/.werkmeister\fR and converges the rest.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister machine setup           # guided
werkmeister machine setup \-\-check   # report state, change nothing
werkmeister machine setup \-\-yes     # accept every default
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
